   117	Nobody offered him anything. Cael had a sentence ready about how that was not his fault and had the sense, at the last, to recognize it as a thing he wanted to say for his own comfort, and swallowed it, and later entered the swallowing in the log as the only decision he was proud of all evening.
   118	
